# Don't run servers

- Never start `vite`, `npm run dev`, `vite preview` or any other server on your own.
- Don't take Playwright or browser screenshots to check your work unless the user asks for it.
- Make the requested file changes and stop. The user runs the dev server and checks the result themselves.
